{"abstract":[{"text":"Load static PNG and JPEG images safely on macOS and Linux.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PlatformImageLoader","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" uses vendored, namespaced pure Swift format decoders and always returns non-premultiplied 8-bit RGBA pixels in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Animated images and formats other than PNG and JPEG are not supported. JPEG input is limited to 8-bit grayscale and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"three-component color images."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The format decoder is independent from file and URL lifecycle code. Decoding the same bytes with the same limits therefore produces the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same pixels without accessing the network.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Loading Data or Files","anchor":"Loading-Data-or-Files","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let loader = PlatformImageLoader()","let fromData = try loader.loadImage(from: encodedData)","let fromFile = try loader.loadImage(from: \"\/absolute\/path\/image.png\")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Both entry points apply the same validation and return ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoadError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" when the input cannot be read or decoded.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Resource Limits","anchor":"Resource-Limits","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configure "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecodingLimits","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" when creating the loader:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let limits = ImageDecodingLimits(","    maxInputBytes: 8 * 1_024 * 1_024,","    maxDimension: 4_096,","    maxPixelCount: 12_000_000,","    maxFrameCount: 1,","    maxDecodedBytes: 48 * 1_024 * 1_024,","    maxDecompressedBytes: 48 * 1_024 * 1_024",")","let loader = PlatformImageLoader(limits: limits)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit inspects the image header and validates encoded bytes, dimensions, pixels, frames, decompressed source samples, and the final RGBA"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"allocation before invoking a format decoder. A per-call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxPixelCount"},{"type":"text","text":" can tighten the loader-wide pixel limit but cannot loosen it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PNG ancillary metadata is discarded because "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage"},{"type":"text","text":" has no metadata surface. This also prevents compressed text or color-profile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"chunks from allocating outside the image decompression limit. PNG image-data chunks are fed to the decoder in bounded pieces, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"malformed trailing decompressed data is rejected."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"URL loading streams encoded bytes and cancels the transfer as soon as ","type":"text"},{"code":"maxInputBytes","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is exceeded. Cached images are revalidated against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the current loader’s dimensions, pixels, frame, and final allocation limits before they are returned."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecoding","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"role":"collectionGroup","title":"Image Decoding","roleHeading":"API Collection"},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem"],"anchor":"Guides","generated":true,"title":"Guides"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PlatformImageLoader","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoader"],"anchor":"Loading","title":"Loading"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecodingLimits","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBA","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageLoadError"],"anchor":"Data-and-Limits","title":"Data and Limits"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/imagedecoding"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/StateManagement":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/statemanagement","kind":"article","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Manage reactive state in your TUIkit application.","type":"text"}],"role":"article","title":"State Management"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/KeyboardShortcuts":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/keyboardshortcuts","abstract":[{"text":"How keyboard input flows through TUIkit: from raw terminal bytes to your view handlers.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","title":"Keyboard Shortcuts","role":"collectionGroup"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/StatusBarGuide":{"url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/statusbarguide","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","title":"Status Bar","abstract":[{"text":"Configure the shortcut bar at the bottom of the terminal.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","role":"article"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/CustomViews":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Build your own views by composing existing ones or creating custom view modifiers.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","role":"collectionGroup","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/customviews","title":"Custom Views","kind":"article"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/RGBAImage":{"title":"RGBAImage","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RGBAImage","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/rgbaimage","abstract":[{"text":"A raw image stored as a flat array of RGBA pixels in row-major order.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RGBAImage"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RGBAImage"}]},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/ThemingGuide":{"type":"topic","title":"Theming Guide","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/themingguide","role":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Customize the visual appearance of your TUIkit application with palettes.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","kind":"article"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/LayoutSystem":{"title":"Layout System","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Understand the two-pass layout used by stacks a